For example, a person working as a Driver in the Armoured Corps and driving fighting vehicles or mechanical transport vehicles will be given driver-cum-mechanic certificates; a person working as Operator Fire Controller or a person working as a General Duty in the infantry would be provided with certificates of Gym Assistant, Warehouse Packer, CCTV Video Footage Auditor, Front Office Assistant, Data Entry Operator, Fireman, etc.;
similarly, a person working as a Gunner in Artillery would be provided with a certificate of Fire Tech and Safety Manager, Fireman, Surveyor, Data Entry Operator, etc.
